 "sentences": [
  "Kim Clijsters retired from tennis at just 23 years old.",
  "She was a world No. 1 in both singles and doubles.",
  "She won 41 singles titles, including four majors.",
  "She and Justine Henin led Belgium to their first Fed Cup in 2001.",
  "After losing her first four major finals, she finally won the 2005 US Open.",
  "Injuries and a lost desire to compete ultimately led to her early 2007 retirement."
